*** PRELUDE
*** Precision-zero decimal conversion covers denominators beyond u64 and all finite IEEE-754 magnitudes.
set show timing off .
red in CONVERSION : decFloat(0.1, 0) .
red in CONVERSION : decFloat(0.00001, 0) .
red in CONVERSION : decFloat(1.0e-20, 0) .
red in CONVERSION : decFloat(-1.0e-20, 0) .
red in CONVERSION : decFloat(2.2250738585072014e-308, 0) .
red in CONVERSION : decFloat(4.9406564584124654e-324, 0) .
*** Positive precision remains the rounded path.
red in CONVERSION : decFloat(4.9406564584124654e-324, 5) .
